### Page 1 of 17

```text
MEMO

TO:

Honorable Mayor Patrick J. Collins, City of Cheyenne
Members of the City Council, City of Cheyenne

FROM:
Sam Berta

DATE:
March 8th, 2024

SUBJECT:
Professional Service Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and DHM Design
P.C., for engineering services of the 15th Street Master Plan Project.

Please find the attached Professional Service Agreement between the City and DHM Design P.C.
for engineering services related to the construction of the 15th Street Project.

Engineering Staff evaluates fee proposals for engineering services based on time and material
estimates for the specific project.  Those costs are readily tracked and verified during design
operations and the City only pays for the actual time expended. We believe this agreement will
provide the required services to complete the final design and construction documentation portion
of the project.

The fees include services for project management, all construction documentation, and final plan
creation. Funding for this project will come from the 2019-2022 1% Optional Purpose Tax Fund
(5th Penny). The total professional services will be a cost not-to-exceed $153,055.00. We
respectfully request your approval of this professional services agreement.

CITY ENGINEER’S OFFICE
2101 O’Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
```

